
== 0. Prasyarat
.env tidak ditemukan — memakai password default compose. Bila stack lama memakai password kustom, langkah 0 akan gagal; isi .env dulu.

== 0b. Jalankan postgres lama dan periksa password .env
  > docker compose -f /home/hatch/workspace/UMNIA-APP/deploy/windows/compose.yml -p umnia-legacy up -d postgres-business

== 1. Dump database lama (custom format, --no-owner)
  > docker compose -f /home/hatch/workspace/UMNIA-APP/deploy/windows/compose.yml -p umnia-legacy exec -T postgres-business pg_dump -U umnia_bootstrap -d umnia_business --no-owner -Fc -f /tmp/umnia-backup.dump
pg_dump: error: connection to server on socket "/var/run/postgresql/.s.PGSQL.55436" failed: FATAL:  role "umnia_bootstrap" does not exist

UPGRADE GAGAL: Perintah gagal (exit 1): docker compose -f /home/hatch/workspace/UMNIA-APP/deploy/windows/compose.yml -p umnia-legacy exec -T postgres-business pg_dump -U umnia_bootstrap -d umnia_business --no-owner -Fc -f /tmp/umnia-backup.dump
JALUR PEMULIHAN: volume lama masih utuh.
  docker compose -f /home/hatch/workspace/UMNIA-APP/deploy/windows/compose.yml -p umnia-legacy up -d
